SM57 & Royer R-121) as line amplifier (no compression) to increase harmonic content.\n- Little Labs Redeye 3D Phantom Direct Box & Re-Amp Box\n- Universal Audio Apollo Twin Audio Interface\n- Evidence Audio Lyric HG Instrument Cables\n- Mogami 2549 Microphone Cables\n\nEnjoy :)\n\n- Ginda Bestari || Desmond Studio -','\n', char(10)), '["featured", "tone3000", "nam", "fender twin reverb"]', 'TONE3000 Community', '2026-02-04 03:12:56.852956', '2026-02-04 03:13:12.542488', 0, NULL, 'https://www.tone3000.com/api/v1/models/289461/download/7fxhli7079v.nam', 1, 18, '289461', 'NEW VERSION | Fender DRRI | Clean | SM57 + Royer R-121 (No Room) | Full Rig');
